<title>GERMANY: Siemens sees current yr EPS about the same.</title>
<headline>Siemens sees current yr EPS about the same.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German electronics group Siemens AG expects its earnings per share to be about the same in the business year that ends on September 30 from the previous year, the company's finance chief Karl-Hermann Baumann said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be no great change this year,&quot; he told reporters. &quot;It will remain around 4.50 marks.&quot;</p>
<p>Siemens EPS based on the German Financial Analysts (DVFA) method was 4.48 marks the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097 150</p>
